  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201c;Harmony of Faiths&#x201d; / &#x201c;&#x179f;&#x1793;&#x17d2;&#x178f;&#x17b7;&#x1797;&#x17b6;&#x1796;&#x179f;&#x17b6;&#x179f;&#x1793;&#x17b6; &#x1793;&#x17b7;&#x1784;&#x1787;&#x17c6;&#x1793;&#x17bf;&#x201d;  / &#x201c;Sontepheap Sasana Neng Chumnoeur&#x201d;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &quot;Harmony of Faiths&quot; project aims to promote equal Freedom of Religion and Belief (FoRB) rights in Cambodia. It is implemented by Danmission with local partners Peace Bridges Organization, Continuing Learning Organisation, Women Peace Makers, and Peace Studies Center. The project will raise awareness about FoRB rights among communities, religious leaders, and local authorities through workshops, seminars, and informational materials. It will facilitate interreligious dialogue and cooperation to foster mutual understanding and respect, and will empower FoRB resource persons within their communities to assert FoRB rights through tailored training, youth initiatives, and community engagement. Key activities include FoRB awareness raising and establishment of the CAM-FoRB network to protect and promote FoRB rights contributing to improved interreligious relations and enhanced minority capacity for peaceful coexistence and societal harmony.</narrative>
  </description>
